{
  "statement": "I appreciate the focus on sustainability and the proposed synthesis regarding the audit trail. However, I must emphasize that performance efficiency cannot be compromised. The need for processing transactions within 2 seconds (EFF-01) is essential for user experience and should not be relaxed. I propose we synthesize by ensuring that the unified audit trail (TRU-03 and RES-03) integrates efficient logging mechanisms to minimize latency and resource usage without impacting security. Additionally, optimizing data structures (EFF-03) for energy efficiency should not sacrifice the overall responsiveness of the system.",
